<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<model>
    <name>vacuum_dock</name>
    <version>1.0</version>
    <sdf version="1.6">model.sdf</sdf>
    <author>
        <name>Ilia O.</name>
        <email>iliao@kaia.ai</email>
    </author>
    <description>Auto-empty and mop-wash charging dock for oomwoo_one, 0.440 x 0.500 x 0.580 m, authored from primitives. A tall tower carrying a dust-bag door and twin water-tank windows sits over a drive-in bay the robot reverses into. The bay is sized from the robot: 0.400 wide (20 mm either side of its 0.359 m bumper), 0.470 deep (it fits entirely inside) and 0.170 high (73 mm over its 0.097 m LiDAR turret). Its floor is flush with the room floor, so there is nothing to climb. The bay has NO collision geometry - only the shell, back panel and side walls do - so the robot can sit inside it without being ejected by the physics. Brass charging contacts sit on the back wall at bumper height.</description>
</model>
